Chondrite Escapement

Ingredients: PROGRESSIVE METAL + BEBOP + CELESTIAL, SPACE & ORBITAL + French Horn + 2020s ERA  
Creative Catalyst: Musical instruments are hand-forged by fusing nickel-iron meteorite fragments with the high-precision gears and escapements of centuries-old pocket watches.

Chondrite Escapement sounds like a high-velocity particle collision inside a Swiss watchmaker's planetary observatory: Dizzy Gillespie's blistering, chromatic bebop runs grafted onto the syncopated, sub-drop down-tuning of modern progressive djent, steered through cosmic turbulence by a screaming, microtonally altered French horn. Ticking antique balance wheels rattle against eight-string pallasite-iron fretboards, producing a hyper-technical music that swings at 300 BPM while simultaneously crushing dynamic headroom with orbital mass.

